<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><link href="https://zovo.one/favicon.ico" rel="icon"/><meta charset="utf-8"/> <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/><title>Free Word Cloud Generator - Create Tag Clouds Online | Zovo | Free Online Tool</title> <link rel="canonical" href="https://zovo.one/free-tools/word-cloud-generator/"><meta content="Free online word cloud generator. Paste text or upload a file, customize colors, fonts, and shapes. Export as PNG. No sign-up required. 100% client-side." name="description"/><meta content="Michael Lip" name="author"/><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://fonts.gstatic.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https:"/><meta http-equiv="X-Frame-Options" content="DENY"/><meta http-equiv="X-Content-Type-Options" content="nosniff"/><meta http-equiv="Referrer-Policy" content="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"/><meta http-equiv="Permissions-Policy" content="geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()"/><meta content="Free Word Cloud Generator - Create Tag Clouds Online | Zovo" property="og:title"/><meta content="Generate word clouds from any text. Customize colors, fonts, shapes, and export as PNG. 100% free and private." property="og:description"/><meta content="website" property="og:type"/><meta content="https://tools.zovo.one/word-cloud-generator/" property="og:url"/><meta content="Zovo" property="og:site_name"/><meta content="https://zovo.one/og-image.png" property="og:image"/><meta content="summary_large_image" name="twitter:card"/><meta content="Free Word Cloud Generator - Create Tag Clouds Online | Zovo" name="twitter:title"/><meta content="Generate word clouds from any text. Customize colors, fonts, shapes, and export as PNG. 100% free and private." name="twitter:description"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/><link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/><script type="application/ld+json"> { "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [ { "@type": "Question", "name": "What is a word cloud?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "A word cloud is a visual representation of text data where words are displayed in varying sizes based on their frequency of occurrence. The most frequently used words appear largest, making it easy to identify key themes and patterns in any body of text at a glance." }}, { "@type": "Question", "name": "How do I create a word cloud?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Paste your text into the input area or upload a.txt file. The tool automatically counts word frequencies, removes common stop words, and renders a word cloud on the canvas. You can customize colors, fonts, shapes, and the maximum number of words before generating." }}, { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can I export the word cloud as an image?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Click the Export PNG button to download your word cloud as a high-resolution PNG image. The exported image matches the canvas dimensions and includes all your customization settings." }}, { "@type": "Question", "name": "What are stop words and why are they removed?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Stop words are common words like the, is, at, and, or that appear frequently in any text but carry little meaning. Removing them ensures your word cloud highlights the meaningful content words rather than being dominated by grammatical filler." }}, { "@type": "Question", "name": "What color schemes are available?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "The generator includes five color schemes: rainbow (full spectrum), monochrome (shades of a single color), warm (reds, oranges, yellows), cool (blues, greens, purples), and custom where you pick two colors and the tool interpolates between them." }}, { "@type": "Question", "name": "What shape masks can I use?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "You can render your word cloud in four shapes: rectangle (fills the full canvas), circle, heart, and star. The shape mask constrains where words are placed, creating a visually distinctive output." }}, { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is there a word limit for the input text?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "There is no strict limit on input text length. The tool processes the text entirely in your browser, so performance depends on your device. For best results with very large texts, you can adjust the max words slider to control how many unique words appear in the cloud." }}, { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is my text data private?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. All processing happens in your browser using client-side JavaScript. Your text is never uploaded to any server. There are no analytics tracking your input, no cookies storing your data, and no server-side processing. Your content stays on your device." }} ] } </script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "WebApplication", "name": "Free Word Cloud Generator - Create Tag Clouds Online", "description": "Free online word cloud generator. Paste text or upload a file, customize colors, fonts, and shapes. Export as PNG. No sign-up required. 100% client-side.", "url": "https://zovo.one/free-tools/word-cloud-generator/", "applicationCategory": "DesignApplication", "operatingSystem": "Web", "offers": {"@type": "Offer", "price": "0", "priceCurrency": "USD"}, "author": {"@type": "Person", "name": "Michael Lip"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem